# Route: guide 11 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 27 to 29, 30
# quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ashenvale): Mystral Lake -> The Zoram Strand -> Night Run -> Fallen
# Sky Lake -> Raynewood Retreat -> Night Run -> Fallen Sky Lake -> Night Run
# -> Satyrnaar -> Astranaar -> The Ruins of Stardust -> Astranaar ->
# Thistlefur Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Allegiance to the Old Gods (6564;
# Blackfathom Tide Priestess 20-21).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the Old Gods
# (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins (6921), Amongst
# the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922).

